        "level": 2,
        "text": "Put the code inside the if block for /api/config in server.js.\n\nIn server.js:\n```\n  if (req.url === \"/api/config\") { const { apiKey, ...publicConfig } = config; return send(res, 200, publicConfig); }\n```"
